# Adlaire-Design Icon Set Catalog

This catalog governs the official 500 SVG icons stored in `Icons/`.

The icon set contains exactly 500 SVG files. The file system is the implementation inventory; this catalog defines governance, category rules, usage rules, and verification rules.

## Categories

| Category | Role |
| --- | --- |
| `navigation` | Navigation, layout, routing, panels, and view movement. |
| `action` | User actions such as save, edit, delete, copy, upload, and export. |
| `status` | Success, warning, error, loading, empty, maintenance, and state signals. |
| `content` | Documents, code, repository, issue, PR, release, and content structure. |
| `editor` | WYSIWYG Editor UI concepts and editing operations. |
| `media` | Image, video, audio, avatar, gallery, and media operations. |
| `form` | Inputs, validation, calendar, upload, and form states. |

## Rules

| Item | Rule |
| --- | --- |
| Count | `Icons/` contains exactly 500 SVG files. |
| Format | SVG only. |
| Naming | `adlaire-icon-<category>-<name>.svg`. |
| State | Implemented icon files are `実装済み`. |
| Decorative icons | Use empty alt text when the icon is decorative. |
| Meaning icons | Provide a contextual label at the usage site. |
| Catalog source | Category and usage policy are governed here; concrete files live in `Icons/`. |

## Boundaries

- Brand assets belong in `Brand/` and `Docs/Brand_Asset_Catalog`.
- Icon display UI belongs in `Docs/Generic_Component_Catalog` and generated UI CSS.
- JavaScript behavior is not part of the icon catalog.

## Catalog Governance

| Item | Rule |
| --- | --- |
| Implementation state | Use `実装済み`, `策定済み`, or `対象外`. |
| Out of scope | Brand assets, icon display UI behavior, JavaScript behavior. |
| Synchronization | Update `Docs/Master_Spec`, this catalog, `Icons/`, and checks when needed. |
| Change unit | Specification, catalog, SVG files, and check updates are reviewed together. |

Samples can demonstrate icon usage and link to the official 500 SVG icons, but Samples are not the source of truth.
